1
00:00:00,036 --> 00:00:02,456
(Sheldon:)This on a night
that I had originally designated...

2
00:00:02,622 --> 00:00:05,542
...for solving space-time geometry
in higher-spin gravity...

3
00:00:05,708 --> 00:00:07,588
(Sheldon:)...and building my Lego Death Star.

4
00:00:09,253 --> 00:00:10,293
(Sheldon:)And why?

5
00:00:10,505 --> 00:00:12,465
(Sheldon:)Your gal pals, Penny and Bernadette...

6
00:00:12,632 --> 00:00:15,592
(Sheldon:)...went out shopping for
some wedding nonsense without Amy...

7
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:19,100
(Sheldon:)...an action they took with no thought
as to how it would affect me...

8
00:00:19,263 --> 00:00:22,553
(Sheldon:)...the future of string theory
or my Lego fun time.

9
00:00:24,268 --> 00:00:25,938
(Howard:)What do you want us to do about it?

10
00:00:26,104 --> 00:00:28,144
You weren't listening
to my topic sentence.

11
00:00:28,314 --> 00:00:29,944
(Sheldon:)Get your women in line.

12
00:00:31,442 --> 00:00:33,732
(Sheldon:)Make them apologize to Amy
and set things right.

13
00:00:33,903 --> 00:00:36,653
(Sheldon:)I am a man of science,
not someone's snuggle bunny.

14
00:00:37,615 --> 00:00:40,655
(Leonard:)Why do I have to talk to Penny?
She's not my girIfriend.

15
00:00:40,827 --> 00:00:42,747
You invited her to Iunch
four years ago.

16
00:00:42,912 --> 00:00:45,792
(Sheldon:)Everything about her is on you.
You make it so.

17
00:00:48,543 --> 00:00:50,123
- Moo Shu is Penny.
- Thank you.

18
00:00:50,294 --> 00:00:52,754
(Penny:)- Where's Sheldon?
- Oh, he was up late last night...

19
00:00:52,922 --> 00:00:56,092
(Leonard:)...so I gave him an early dinner
and put him to bed.

20
00:00:56,634 --> 00:00:57,674
(Bernadette:)That's so sweet.

21
00:00:57,844 --> 00:01:02,024
(Leonard:)Yeah, but now he's gonna be up
at dawn and wanna play.

